* Tests: 00:00Z as an end time, in an interval and in a weekday command.
* Write 24:00Z of the day before.

AC D
AY TRA
AN Example TRA 1
AA 2026-07-04T18:00Z/2026-07-05T00:00Z
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E

